  "Acquired by INHALATION of Livestock Birth Aerosols (Placenta of Cattle, Sheep, Goats) or Unpasteurized Milk (NO Tick Vector in Humans!)": "Epidemiology: Worldwide zoonosis in cattle, sheep, goats, cats, dogs, and rabbits (massive concentrations in livestock placentas).",
  "Actin-Rocket Motility (ActA)": "ActA (Actin-Rocket Motility): Localized at one pole of the bacterium, ActA coordinates host actin filament assembly into a tail that propels the bacterium to the plasma membrane, forming a protrusion (filopod) that pushes it directly into…",
