  "Botulinum Toxin (Types A, B, E, F — Heat-Labile Zinc Endopeptidase A-B Neurotoxin)": "Botulinum Neurotoxin (150-kDa A-B Zinc Endopeptidase): Complexed with nontoxic proteins that protect it from gastric digestion.",
