  "Cystitis, Pyelonephritis & Staghorn Calculi": "Urinary Tract Infections & Renal Calculi: Cystitis, pyelonephritis, and struvite/apatite staghorn kidney stones (which harbor bacteria and cause recurrent UTIs).",
  "Death Within 1–2 Days Without Immediate Surgery & Antibiotics": "Nontraumatic Myonecrosis (Spontaneous Gas Gangrene) & Septicemia: Fulminant gas-forming muscle destruction and shock; most patients die within 1–2 days of presentation without emergent intervention.",
  "Deep Pyogenic Abscesses (Brain, Liver, Oropharynx)": "S. anginosus Group: Includes S. anginosus , S. constellatus , and S. intermedius ; hallmarked by pinpoint colonies, butterscotch odor, and deep brain/liver/pleural abscesses.",
  "Deli Meats & Unpasteurized Soft Cheese": "Prevention: No vaccine exists. High-risk patients (pregnant, elderly, immunocompromised) should avoid unpasteurized milk/soft cheeses, raw or undercooked deli meats/hot dogs, and unwashed raw vegetables.",
  "Delicate Beaded Branching Filamentous Rods + Aerial Hyphae": "Aerial Hyphae: Filamentous projections protruding upward from the colony surface; combined with weak acid-fastness, this rapidly identifies Nocardia .",
